<para>If no such set bit exists, advance to <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_coalescing_bit_vector_1a4094e1a4b11c655a8208dd9d7b306c43" kindref="member">end()</ref>. This is like std::lower_bound. This is useful if <computeroutput>Index</computeroutput> is close to the current iterator position. However, unlike <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_coalescing_bit_vector_1a84519c831af8bdd490359710a57bea17" kindref="member">find()</ref>, this has worst-case O(n) performance. </para>
